is proving to be transformational for organizations of every size. The C-suite is leading the charge to adopt ESM, in pursuit of the enormous business benefits.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--qPvKM23u--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2009","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2020-10-18T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"J4RHWo5IR","title":"5 back-end frameworks for better cross-platform development","url":"https://techbeacon.com/app-dev-testing/5-back-end-frameworks-better-cross-platform-development","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/5-back-end-frameworks-for-better-cross-platform-development-j4rhwo5ir","summary":"The role of a back-end framework is to allow you to complete server-driven actions. Front-end software development frameworks focus on web apps, but that's no longer the world we live in. You can effectively bring front-end tools to mobile, desktop, and IoT apps. Here's what you need to know about five popular back- end development frameworks.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/d41b75d92a79461b5e7614384dee708e","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2020-10-12T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"JDWE3ayoo","title":"How to empower elite DevSecOps performers","url":"https://techbeacon.com/security/how-empower-elite-devsecops-performers","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-empower-elite-devsecops-performers-jdwe3ayoo","summary":"The key differentiator for those DevOps-focused software engineers is velocity. Building the right pipes and process helps create an elastic, scalable, and secured infrastructure and applications.Here's how you can use cloud and DevOps principles to leverage and automate security. The most recent Accelerate: State of DevOps Report describes what elite-performing DevOps engineers look like.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/19726588a1754a5a539c57de77210b5e","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2020-10-09T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"-hmXNgwwO","title":"Chrome 86 is  \u2026 HEY, DevOps: Wake up and pay attention","url":"https://techbeacon.com/security/chrome-86-hey-devops-wake-pay-attention","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/chrome-86-is-hey-devops-wake-up-and-pay-attention--hmxngwwo","summary":"Chrome 86 rolls out with massive user security enhancements. Google now blocks mixed content downloads for executables and archives. Chrome 86 also features a new \u201cSafety Tip\u201d on sites that look \u201cvery similar\u201d to those of other ones. Eiji Kitamura massacres: [Today is a good day to be fired]","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/556348b9654c44842a44d69c7821f31a","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2020-10-08T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"JZNdGT8Xq","title":"Why you should burn your ticketing system","url":"https://techbeacon.com/enterprise-it/why-you-should-burn-your-ticketing-system","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/why-you-should-burn-your-ticketing-system-jzndgt8xq","summary":"Ticketing systems are one of the most common obstacles that hold IT operations teams back from becoming high-performing. The more of this type of work you try to push through the system, the worse the system will perform. If your organization is designed in such a way that the value stream flows through humans operating on a ticket, then your ticketing system is designed to track toil.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/2275b14685a38a021c95d06add8dc7fd","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2020-10-08T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"_J4viPFr-","title":"How to reduce cognitive load and increase flow: 5 real-world examples","url":"https://techbeacon.com/devops/how-reduce-cognitive-load-increase-flow-5-real-world-examples","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-reduce-cognitive-load-and-increase-flow-5-real-world-examples--j4vipfr","summary":"Team Topologies can help your organization improve the effectiveness of software delivery and accelerate time-to-value. A primary theme is that you need to use \"team cognitive load\" as a key architectural and organizational design element. By using it to determine the size of services and applications, you can avoid an obsession with 20-line microservices and escape the monolith quagmire.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/c2ec4341c35c2230b35a16e397da226e","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2020-10-07T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"pX-WaYw8S","title":"How to leap over the obstacles holding back your QA teams","url":"https://techbeacon.com/app-dev-testing/how-leap-over-obstacles-holding-back-your-qa-teams","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-leap-over-the-obstacles-holding-back-your-qa-teams-px-wayw8s","summary":"An agile coach proposes forming teams that serve as \"impediment-removal engines\" The teams would be made up of people higher up in the organizational hierarchy. The team would organize itself just as the project teams that worked under them did. The strategy worked, but it turned out that one team wasn't enough.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/b14b711329ce75ccd7a54f466a34a869","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2020-10-06T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"WbhDVYt_a","title":"INSPIRE 20 Podcast: Tanya Janca, We Hack Purple","url":"https://techbeacon.com/enterprise-it/inspire-20-podcast-tanya-janca-we-hack-purple","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/inspire-20-podcast-tanya-janca-we-hack-purple-wbhdvyt-a","summary":"Tanya Janca is founder, security trainer, and coach at online learning academy We Hack Purple. She and a male friend crashed a Python meetup where she was the only woman. In her INSPIRE 20 podcast, she talks about the importance of hiring and maintaining a diverse workforce.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/370f1e830643efd06702e36d237adb92","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2020-10-05T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"Jz8o8QUSI","title":"The cybersecurity resource problem: 4 ways to get proactive","url":"https://techbeacon.com/security/cybersecurity-resource-problem-4-ways-get-proactive","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-cybersecurity-resource-problem-4-ways-to-get-proactive-jz8o8qusi","summary":"The cybersecurity workforce gap in the U.S. was estimated to be nearly 500,000. The pandemic has exacerbated the cybersecurity skills shortage as organizations\u2019 focus and resources have shifted to shoring up, or even building from scratch, work-from-home capabilities. Here's how to strengthen your cybersecurity position.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/ac81629e2ea23b9f4c984a04d7e706f2","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2020-10-05T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"jyXx1TsqO","title":"Special Report: Buyer's Guide to AIOps Management Tools","url":"https://techbeacon.com/enterprise-it/special-report-buyers-guide-aiops-management-tools","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/special-report-buyer-s-guide-to-aiops-management-tools-jyxx1tsqo","summary":"AIOps combines traditional IT operations tooling with machine learning and analytics to help mitigate the complexities of managing emerging multicloud and other types of heterogeneous systems. This Special Report provides IT operations managers with a framework for understanding the state of this complex operations technology. It also provides guidance on how to evaluate and compare the various types of available tools.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/5aa8a51c6b13c895a79e5e560d30a018","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2020-10-02T12:00:00.000Z"}],"similar_handles":["ncameron","brainhub","dribbble","swlh","torquemag"],"opposite_handles":["felixrieseberg","tbpn","alexfinn","ryolu_","kloss_xyz"],"similar":[{"id":"ncameron"